  // differs from 5-8's (AED 17) purely because those orders' gross values were larger, hitting
  // the same CAP 30 ceiling harder (32.00 − 2.00 FD = 30.00 exactly, confirmed against real
  // order gross values in the AED 60-66 range — 50% of that lands right at the cap). Same
  // mechanic throughout, one rule covering the full 5-11 span. AED 65,569 combined across both
  // sub-windows — genuinely material, not a rounding-noise gap.
